  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">A compact design with optimal organization, this card holder wallet easily fits into a wristlet or crossbody bag. Crafted of refined leather detailed with our Signature hardware, the petite design has four card slots and space to keep bills neatly tucked away. It’s finished with a convenient snap-off card case featuring a hero card slot and expandable zip pocket to use on its own when traveling light.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Refined calf leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Detachable card case with one credit card slot and zip pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
